		(uuid "4889a29a-9b46-4144-b506-4237020673c9")
	)
	(text_box "AVDD should be designed with a minimum of 100mV below VSUP voltage. VFB=VBG=1.25V\nWe require AVDD to be at least 100mV lower than DVDD. In this case DVDD is 3.3V, using R4 = 10k we should satisfy this. \nAVDD = VFB*(R4+R3)/R3 = 1.25*(12+10)/10 = 2.75V which is more than 0.1V lower than 3.3V so we are good. RATE pin connected to 3V3 to increase sampling rate from ~10 to ~80 Hz"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 102.87 172.7347 0)
		(size 57.15 20.3053)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8f091a13-e90f-4dd2-907f-b2c5c570ae8b")
	)
	(text_box "Schottky diode used here to prevent reverse current when the device is powered by the battery."
